<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath Bank says '96 net up 16.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sampath Bank says '96 net up 16.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sampath Bank Ltd for the financial year ended 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 1,916.88   vs    1,631.83</p>
<p>     Net profit	 281.93   vs	241.38</p>
<p>     Tax provision    124.11   vs	140.54</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Sampath Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
